# Crew beats: small human moments, most of the log. Idle-friendly beats make an
# absent player's astronaut look good. Each astronaut has a home ship; `same A B`
# beats only happen while someone is visiting in a crossing window.
# House style: content/STYLE.md.

card beat_coffee
type beat
cat life
days 7 39
weight 8
once
roles A B
when same A B
text {A} and {B} bake bread from one recipe in two galley ovens, over the link. Without gravity it rises in every direction at once and comes out shaped like a lung, twice. They eat it warm on camera with the lights down, and agree not to describe it to anyone at home.
do bond A B 5

card beat_zipties
type beat
cat life skill
due
days 11 11
weight 6
once
roles A B
text {A} and {B} get all eight ships to agree on which drawer the zip ties live in. It takes forty-one emails. The ground asks for the list, for the next fleet.
do bond A B 4

card beat_haircut
type beat
cat life
days 12 39
weight 5
once
roles A B
when same A B
when !fired p_birthday
when bond A B >= 0
when away A
when home B
when cond A ok
when !is A eva_who
text {A}, aboard on a visit, cuts {B}'s hair with the vacuum clippers, which clog twice and file a complaint each time. {B} pays in coffee.
do bond A B 5

card beat_home_msg2
type beat
cat human
days 25 39
weight 6
once
roles A
when cond A ok
text The school group writes again: they've built Mars in the classroom out of papier-mâché and want to know if it's the right red. {A} sends back a photo through the window, unprocessed, and a note: "Close. A bit more butterscotch."
do morale A 4

card beat_shelter_night
type beat
cat life
days 8 39
weight 5
once
roles A B
when var storms >= 1
text {A} and {B} compare storm shelters on video and steal each other's best ideas, and a sign, now on every ship, that reads "the Sun is not your friend".
do bond A B 4

card beat_early_watch
type beat
cat wonder
days 1 5
weight 10
once
roles A B
when cond B ok
text {A} and {B} share the night watch over the fleet link. From low orbit Earth fills the window, its dark side strung with cities. {A} holds up a thumb, and the planet spills out around it on every side. They talk about home as if it were down the road. For a few more days, it is.
do bond A B 5

card beat_early_call
type beat
cat human
days 2 5
weight 8
once
roles A B
when cond B ok
text {A} and {B} watch the last top-off tankers come and go and narrate each docking on the fleet channel like a sports commentary. By the third they have a catchphrase; by the fourth it is fleet-wide.
do bond A B 4

# --- Idle-friendly: only for astronauts whose owner hasn't been in for a while ----
card idle_watch
type beat
cat life
days 4 22
weight 10
once
roles A
when idle A >= 3
when cond A ok
text {A} stands the night watch for the whole fleet so the other seven can sleep. Unasked. The watch report is two lines long and neat.
do morale A 2
do trait A warm 2

card idle_mentor
type beat
cat life
days 6 39
weight 8
once
roles A B
when idle A >= 3
when cond B ok
when is B abort_who
text {A} walks {B} through taking the landing by hand over the link: hold, pick a new spot, commit. Step by step, until {B} can call it without the checklist. {A} logs the hours in {B}'s book as training.
do who abort_who B
do bond B A 6
do trait B brave 2

card idle_spares
type beat
once
cat life
days 13 39
weight 8
roles A
when idle A >= 4
when cond A ok
text {A} inventories the spares locker by hand and finds a scrubber cartridge the manifest says was never loaded. Someone at Starbase packed a margin and ticked it in marker. {A} logs a thank-you.
do res spares 1

# --- Quirks: per-crewmate lines from roster.lv `habit "..."` (round 19) -------
# `each habit N` clones the card once per astronaut who has a real Nth habit; the
# clone binds role A to that astronaut only, so a line only ever renders for its
# owner. Three slots, early / mid / late, about 2-3 touches per crewmate a season.
# The table is the roster: a new crew line with its habits gets clones on rebuild.
card quirk_1
type beat
cat life
each habit 1
once
days 2 6
weight 14
roles A
when cond A ok
text {habit}
do morale A 1

card quirk_2
type beat
cat life
each habit 2
once
days 23 29
weight 14
roles A
when cond A ok
text {habit}
do morale A 1

card quirk_3
type beat
cat life
each habit 3
once
days 35 39
weight 14
roles A
when cond A ok
text {habit}
do morale A 1

